wrvPKAax1a_WwUPnTq6Qg&oe=6A5E28F4"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2327305038090996", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821115_2327305041424329_3177732454770005367_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=idb21nBdXV4Q7kNvwEQvQPW&_nc_oc=AdryadSA9TExbQCoPOSP6Q0AqvXWM_ITODYBj2MosUWwRjzbfex-jFpzU1y7QLuoTCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBrUNXyYFcOlfPnerIMK2LKkhgfNyuGLT8qHVvmYQ_KPA&oe=6A5E3170"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1392869219551745", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819356_1392869222885078_161622565437102107_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=anBzaJiquYcQ7kNvwHo5JM9&_nc_oc=AdrkWQIO0d1Zqh9J_elDpdHkN-UzFJhd0QXuqRYtuzqN-I3q71iIYdKx_WIXOa4MVeE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBBrSXDeJl03v7nibERJOoQ5TyFrm4KfXIYF3kWqUiKxw&oe=6A5E326E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rhythm Punch", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Rhythm Punch is a mixed reality experience that transforms your real environment into an interactive space where music drives every move. Punch targets in sync with the beat, build combos, and improve your precision while developing reflexes, coordination, and physical endurance.\n\nDesigned to be both intuitive and challenging, the game adapts to players looking for fun as well as those seeking an active workout. Every hit matters, and every miss is a chance to refine your timing and control.\n\nOne of its key features is the ability to generate levels from your own music. Upload your favorite songs and turn them into playable experiences tailored to your style.\n\nWith mixed reality, Rhythm Punch integrates gameplay directly into your surroundings, enhancing immersion and freedom of movement. No cables, no limits\u2014just you, the rhythm, and your reflexes.\n\nGet ready to feel the music, break your records, and push your energy to the next level.", "short_description": "Rhythm Punch is a mixed reality game where you punch targets to the beat of the music in your own space. Improve your reflexes, coordination, and stamina while training with every song. Generate levels from your own music and enjoy an immersive, intense, and fun experience that blends rhythm and fitness in real time."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "963651653028622", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rhythm Punch", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Rhythm Punch es una experiencia de realidad mixta que transforma tu espacio real en un entorno interactivo donde la m\u00fasica gu\u00eda cada movimiento. Golpea objetivos sincronizados con el ritmo, mejora tu precisi\u00f3n y mant\u00e9n combos mientras desarrollas reflejos, coordinaci\u00f3n y resistencia f\u00edsica.\n\nDise\u00f1ado para ser intuitivo y desafiante, el juego se adapta tanto a quienes buscan diversi\u00f3n como a quienes quieren entrenar de forma activa. Cada golpe cuenta, y cada error es una oportunidad para mejorar tu timing y control.\n\nUna de sus funciones clave es la generaci\u00f3n de mapas a partir de tu propia m\u00fasica. Puedes cargar tus canciones y convertirlas en niveles jugables, creando experiencias \u00fanicas adaptadas a tu estilo.\n\nGracias a la realidad mixta, Rhythm Punch integra el juego directamente en tu entorno, aumentando la inmersi\u00f3n y la libertad de movimiento. Sin cables, sin l\u00edmites: solo t\u00fa, el ritmo y tus reflejos.\n\nPrep\u00e1rate para sentir la m\u00fasica, romper tus r\u00e9cords y llevar tu energ\u00eda al siguiente nivel.", "short_description": "Rhythm Punch es un juego de realidad mixta donde golpeas objetivos al ritmo de la m\u00fasica en tu propio entorno. Mejora tus reflejos, coordinaci\u00f3n y resistencia mientras entrenas con cada canci\u00f3n. Genera mapas a partir de tu m\u00fasica y vive una experiencia inmersiva, intensa y divertida que combina 